sentences.text:
Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The judgment and award dated 30.01.2020 passed in MVC.No.655/2018 by II Additional Senior Civil Judge and Motor Accident Claims Tribunal, Hassan, is modified;
iii) The claimants would be entitled to a sum of Rs.21,36,264/- as against Rs.16,82,800/-;
iv) The enhanced compensation amount shall be paid by the respondent-Insurance Company with interest at 6% per annum, within a period of four - 10 - NC: 2024:KHC:1695 weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this judgment;
v) The compensation amount shall be released in favour of the appellants-claimants upon proper verification;
vi) All other terms and conditions stipulated by the tribunal shall stand intact.

